A line after a marker line folded into a sublist item folds too

```
1. - a
     - y
      1. ~~~
z
.
<ol>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>a
        <ul>
          <li>y</li>
        </ul>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <pre><code></code></pre>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ol>
<p>z</p>
```
